1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:06,790
A policy that inserts a peg in simulation may jam when the real robot moves slightly differently.
仿真会插的策略，到真机可能因细小偏差卡住。

2
00:00:07,290 --> 00:00:13,630
IndustReal tackles both sides of that gap: what the simulator teaches and how hardware executes the learned actions.
IndustReal 同时处理训练环境和动作执行的差距。

3
00:00:14,328 --> 00:00:19,808
Some simulated states let parts penetrate each other in ways that cannot happen physically.
仿真有时让零件发生现实中不可能的穿透。

4
00:00:20,808 --> 00:00:28,508
Simulation-aware policy updates filter or down-weight those experiences, reducing the incentive to exploit numerical artifacts during training.
训练时过滤或降低这类经验权重，减少投机。

5
00:00:29,077 --> 00:00:34,837
A signed-distance-based reward provides geometric guidance toward the assembled configuration.
基于距离场的奖励，引导零件靠近装配目标。

6
00:00:35,537 --> 00:00:45,277
A sampling curriculum changes initial difficulty as learning progresses, helping the policy discover contact-rich insertion instead of relying only on rare terminal rewards.
再通过初始难度课程，帮助策略发现正确插入动作。

7
00:00:45,843 --> 00:00:52,143
On hardware, small tracking errors can stop repeated relative actions from reaching their intended target.
真机跟踪偏差，会让相对动作始终到不了目标。

8
00:00:52,603 --> 00:01:01,803
Policy-level action integration accumulates commands before impedance control, helping reduce steady-state bias without retraining the policy on real demonstrations.
策略层累积动作，再用阻抗控制减少稳态偏差。

9
00:01:02,583 --> 00:01:08,403
The setup uses a Franka arm, a wrist depth camera, known CAD geometry, and calibration.
系统仍需 Franka、腕部深度相机、CAD 和标定。

10
00:01:08,983 --> 00:01:16,343
The policy does not consume force-torque observations; compliant control alone should not be described as an explicit force-sensing policy.
策略不读取力矩观测，柔顺控制不等于力感知策略。

11
00:01:16,935 --> 00:01:22,075
Independent insertion completes one hundred of one hundred twenty physical trials.
独立插入一百二十次真机试验，完整完成一百次。

12
00:01:22,575 --> 00:01:28,835
One hundred ten trials achieve engagement, a looser condition that can leave the part short of its fully seated target.
接合有一百一十次，但接合不一定完全到位。

13
00:01:29,429 --> 00:01:34,889
The full pick-place-insert pipeline completes one hundred seven of one hundred twenty trials.
拿取、放置、插入全流程，一百二十次完成一百零七次。

14
00:01:35,249 --> 00:01:43,829
Its initialization and grasp conditions differ from the isolated insertion experiment, so the higher percentage does not show that longer tasks are easier.
初态和抓持条件不同，不能说长任务反而更容易。

15
00:01:44,538 --> 00:01:51,538
Reported submillimeter clearances describe how tightly the parts fit, not measured camera or end-effector error.
亚毫米间隙描述零件配合，不是相机或末端误差。

16
00:01:51,898 --> 00:01:58,738
Gripper slip, wedging, and dependence on fixtures remain important limitations when moving beyond the tested assembly conditions.
夹爪滑移、楔紧和工装依赖，仍限制外推。

17
00:01:59,239 --> 00:02:04,959
IndustReal shows that sim-to-real assembly needs more than increasing the number of training episodes.
仿真迁移并非只要增加训练次数。

18
00:02:05,379 --> 00:02:14,159
Geometric rewards, physically plausible experience, and bias-aware execution work together; evaluate each contribution under the same hardware protocol.
几何奖励、可信经验和执行修正，需要配套验证。
